WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.068 --> 00:00:03.106
Hi, I'm LeVar Burton and
we all love to be read to,

00:00:03.106 --> 00:00:05.192
especially children but
I believe adults need

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:08.432
to be read to and millennials especially

00:00:08.432 --> 00:00:10.850
because their lives are so stressful.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:14.017
Today's selection is The ABC's of 2017

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.540
written by Tracy Clayton and Heben Nigatu.

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.519
A is for alternative facts,

00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:24.686
what adults now call lies.

00:00:25.774 --> 00:00:27.756
B is for Beyonce

00:00:27.756 --> 00:00:30.104
and the apples of her eye.

00:00:30.104 --> 00:00:31.771
C is for contouring,

00:00:33.255 --> 00:00:35.194
YouTube's big obsession.

00:00:35.194 --> 00:00:39.155
D is for debt, which a
lot of folks are left in.

00:00:39.155 --> 00:00:43.591
E is for emoji, our
modern romance language.

00:00:43.591 --> 00:00:48.451
F is for fidget spinner because
even our kids are anxious.

00:00:48.451 --> 00:00:49.451
G is for GIF

00:00:50.744 --> 00:00:54.481
and yes, that's really how you say it.

00:00:54.481 --> 00:00:58.510
H is for our heroes who
continue to slay it.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:02.654
I is for impeachment on everybody's minds.

00:01:02.654 --> 00:01:06.919
J is for The Juice,
who's loose another time.

00:01:06.919 --> 00:01:08.252
K is for the KKK

00:01:09.547 --> 00:01:12.238
who feels safe to come out of hiding.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.655
L is for love is love is love

00:01:15.815 --> 00:01:18.951
to counter the hatred and fighting.

00:01:18.951 --> 00:01:23.818
M is for millennials who
just can't do anything right.

00:01:23.818 --> 00:01:27.985
N is for no, a word that
helps us fight the good fight.

00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:30.999
O is for the oh, crap,

00:01:32.194 --> 00:01:34.537
what we say when we hear the news.

00:01:34.537 --> 00:01:38.486
P is for Putin, one of
Trump's most trusted boos.

00:01:38.486 --> 00:01:42.638
Q is for questions, which
we'll ask until we croak.

00:01:42.638 --> 00:01:46.305
R is for reading, which
is how we stay woke.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:51.982
S is for sorry, not sorry,
the cry of the unapologetic.

00:01:51.982 --> 00:01:54.619
T is for the trash this world becomes

00:01:54.619 --> 00:01:57.483
if we continue to let it.

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.957
U is for universal health care,

00:01:59.957 --> 00:02:02.498
which we shouldn't have
to move to Canada for.

00:02:02.498 --> 00:02:04.135
V is for voting rights.

00:02:04.135 --> 00:02:06.490
You'd think we were in 1964.

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:10.605
W is for the wonder women
who punch, lasso and kick.

00:02:10.605 --> 00:02:13.906
X is for our ex-boyfriend, Obama,

00:02:13.906 --> 00:02:16.556
on Instagram making us sick.

00:02:16.556 --> 00:02:19.259
Y is for you still getting up every day

00:02:19.259 --> 00:02:21.393
and doing it again tomorrow.

00:02:21.393 --> 00:02:25.746
And z is for the zoo
this world has become.

00:02:25.746 --> 00:02:28.222
Please come back, Obama.

00:02:28.222 --> 00:02:29.222
(whooshing)

00:02:29.222 --> 00:02:32.270
Damn, this is depressing as (beep).

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:34.937
(hip hop music)

00:02:47.016 --> 00:02:49.599
(bell dinging)

00:02:53.442 --> 00:02:55.534
(whistle blow)

